{% if section.blocks.size > 0 or request.design_mode %}
  <section id="reviews" class="section section--sand review-app">
    <div class="section-title"><span class="eyebrow">FROM PET PARENTS</span><h2>Real stories, shared with care.</h2><p>Verified feedback from customers who share life with their pets.</p></div>
    {% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
      {% for block in section.blocks %}{% render block %}{% endfor %}
    {% elsif request.design_mode %}
      <div class="sample-notice">SAMPLE PREVIEW — fictional people, sample ratings and sample purchase data. Hidden from live visitors.</div>
      <div class="review-grid">
        <article class="review-card"><img src="{{ 'krozo-sample-review-emma.png' | asset_url }}" alt="AI-generated fictional pet parent for sample review preview" width="1254" height="1254"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The quality feels thoughtful and the whole experience was beautifully simple.”</p><strong>Emma R. · Fictional sample</strong><small>Preview only · Verified Purchase placement · United States</small></article>
        <article class="review-card"><img src="{{ 'krozo-sample-review-james.png' | asset_url }}" alt="AI-generated fictional pet parent for sample review preview" width="1254" height="1254"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“It fits naturally into our daily routine and looks considered in our home.”</p><strong>James T. · Fictional sample</strong><small>Preview only · Verified Purchase placement · United Kingdom</small></article>
        <article class="review-card"><img src="{{ 'krozo-sample-review-claire.png' | asset_url }}" alt="AI-generated fictional pet parent for sample review preview" width="1254" height="1254"><div class="stars">★★★★☆</div><p>“The details feel premium, and support made everything clear from the start.”</p><strong>Claire M. · Fictional sample</strong><small>Preview only · Verified Purchase placement · Canada</small></article>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
{% endif %}
{% schema %}{"name":"Verified reviews","blocks":[{"type":"@app"}],"presets":[{"name":"Verified reviews"}]}{% endschema %}
